## 🚀 What I Build

I like building engineering-heavy projects that go deeper than CRUD apps:

- In-memory databases and protocol-level systems
- P2P networking and BitTorrent-style clients
- Realtime collaborative applications
- Privacy-first AI apps with local/on-device LLMs
- Full-stack products with clean architecture and production-style docs

---

## 🧠 Featured Projects

### 🔴 Redis Clone
A Redis-compatible server built from scratch in Node.js.

**Highlights**
- RESP protocol parser
- Strings, Lists, Hashes
- Key expiry
- AOF + RDB persistence
- Master/replica replication
- Pub/Sub messaging
- Transactions
- Interactive sandbox UI

**Tech:** Node.js, TCP, RESP, JavaScript

---

### 🤖 AI RAG Messenger
A privacy-first AI messenger with local/offline AI support.

**Highlights**
- React Native mobile app
- Local SQLite message storage
- Supabase sync and realtime updates
- Clerk authentication
- Local Llama model support
- RAG-based chat Q&A
- Offline mesh messaging with BLE / Wi-Fi Direct

**Tech:** React Native, TypeScript, Supabase, Clerk, SQLite, llama.rn

---

### 🎨 ColabDraw
A realtime collaborative drawing app inspired by Excalidraw.

**Highlights**
- Realtime WebSocket-based drawing
- Shared rooms
- JWT auth
- Role-based access: Owner, Editor, Viewer
- PostgreSQL persistence
- Invite system and notifications
- Security hardening with rate limits and payload limits

**Tech:** Next.js, React, Node.js, WebSockets, Prisma, PostgreSQL

---

### 🧲 BitTorrent Client
A full-stack BitTorrent client built from scratch.

**Highlights**
- BitTorrent wire protocol
- DHT peer discovery
- Magnet link support
- SHA1 piece verification
- Torrent search integration
- Realtime download stats

**Tech:** Node.js, Express, React, Vite, TCP, DHT

